      "side": 0,
      "message": "I think we are still being true to the spec.\n\"...that requires the reconfiguring of any pins on entry to that Mode\"\n\nEntering DP mode does not reconfigure any pins on the UFP. Sending the DP Configure command does. Since the PD spec doesn\u0027t have a Configure command, and it\u0027s a DP specific command I think it\u0027s OK if the DP spec overrides the PD spec.",
